  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup softened butter",
    "2 eggs",
    "2.75 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 teaspoons cream of tartar",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper or lightly grease.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/njV_C--Rq0d-RDt3fmjLkgk0Kfk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ar-240314-grandma-ruths-snickerdoodle-cookies-ddmfs-step-1-021-ce70a52bcf94428abd406a0593b38b9d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240314/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the cookies: Beat white sugar, butter, and eggs together in a large bowl using an electric mixer until smooth and creamy. Combine flour, cream of tartar, baking soda, and salt in a separate bowl; stir into creamed butter mixture until dough holds together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1WT4nDIX005aKhDKpXORhJrlUOI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ar-240314-grandma-ruths-snickerdoodle-cookies-ddmfs-step-2-024-38efa5ad73d443b6b20035c4cd0122c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240314/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the coating: Mix white sugar and cinnamon in a small bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/933-Km6RXaA3BtJp3L20Pm_IFbM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ar-240314-grandma-ruths-snickerdoodle-cookies-ddmfs-step-3-023-e2f9ace032474d8a85bc31bf4c252d0a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240314/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape dough into 2-teaspoon balls; roll in cinnamon-sugar coating until evenly covered. Arrange balls 2 inches apart on prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4G_PJSuFIWU2Az0U8TUk5v-GU8E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ar-240314-grandma-ruths-snickerdoodle-cookies-ddmfs-step-4-025-9cac35c5b6e44f9c9761df141b7f34ef.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240314/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven on the center rack for 7 minutes. Cool on baking sheet for 5 minutes; transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G0lsSv6M4ZDcy0pRgyxCNYFAJnc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ar-240314-grandma-ruths-snickerdoodle-cookies-ddmfs-step-5-040-3a0ecd503e8747afaa84981c0f723659.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240314/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pHGOgGp7-V75VemXAENFGTmMA6Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ar-240314-grandma-ruths-snickerdoodle-cookies-ddmfs-beauty-096-922c6af222164754a73f8ecba34e4da9.jpg"
      ],
